OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSASouth Middlesex council name
OL,4,Achange not approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has written to a new
OL,7,Funitary council to say that it will not
OL,8,Famend parliamentary legislation to
OL,9,Fchange its name to include "South
OL,10,FMiddlesex".
OL,12,FA letter from the Ministry of Housing,
OL,13,FCommunities and Local Government
OL,14,F(MHCLG) said the new West Surrey
OL,15,Fauthority "may wish to take legal
OL,16,Fadvice" about whether it would be able
OL,17,Fto change its name "of its own accord".
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,327,320,200,140,0,100
