OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSASouth Middlesex council name
OL,4,Achange not approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe authority's Liberal Democrat leader
OL,7,FPaul Follows, said it was a
OL,8,F"disappointing response" and the
OL,9,Fcouncil had "begun exploring our legal
OL,10,Foptions".
OL,12,FA spokesperson for MHCLG said the
OL,13,Fcouncil had "the power to change its
OL,14,Fown name to include Middlesex if it
OL,15,Fchooses to do so".
